{"id":"648806","name":"自已做豆腐脑","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/648806/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆花粉","amount":"5O克"}],"sub":[{"name":"内脂","amount":"3克"},{"name":"水","amount":"550毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆花粉50克(1勺是10克)倒入锅里。","img":"images/648806/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入550毫升的水。","img":"images/648806/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅匀静放10分钟。","img":"images/648806/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"点浆内脂3克。","img":"images/648806/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入50克的水化。","img":"images/648806/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"点火，锅里豆浆慢慢的煮开边搅。","img":"images/648806/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"不要沾锅底烧开关火。","img":"images/648806/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"将烧开的豆浆倒入大碗里静止10分钟。","img":"images/648806/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"泡好的内脂水放在碗里一起搅匀。","img":"images/648806/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盖上盖子10分钟(我放了半小个小时)。","img":"images/648806/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"豆腐脑成型了。","img":"images/648806/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"浇上胡辣汤卤。","img":"images/648806/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/648806/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"胡辣汤的计做法:锅里水烧开入紫菜和虾皮调味即可。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}